   360	> `Σ_{i≠j} V_iV_jC_i/(C_i−C_j) = Σ_{i<j} V_iV_j > 0`, contradicting `0`. ∎
   361	
   362	For equal weights this is `W''(C_i) = 0` for all roots of `W = ∏(π−C_i)`, i.e. `W | W''`,
   363	i.e. `deg W ≤ 1`. The automorphism control `(y, x+y^k)` sits exactly at `k = 1` disc.
